  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the Footer**\n\nI\'m now building `src/components/Footer.tsx`. I intend for it to be a quiet footer, including the wordmark, site links, and a plain college student privacy & disclaimer note. No fake execution tags, no fake telemetry, or mechanical comment prefixes will be used.\n\n\n"
